    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">STR (immediate, SIMD&amp;FP)</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Store SIMD&amp;FP register (immediate offset)</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction stores a single SIMD&amp;FP register to memory. The address that is used
for the store is calculated from a base register value and an immediate offset.</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Depending on the settings in the CPACR_EL1,
  CPTR_EL2, and CPTR_EL3 registers,
  and the current Security state and Exception level,
  an attempt to execute the instruction might be trapped.</p>
    
    <p class="desc">
      It has encodings from 3 classes:
      <a href="#iclass_post_index">Post-index</a>
      , 
      <a href="#iclass_pre_index">Pre-index</a>
       and 
      <a href="#iclass_unsigned_offset">Unsigned offset</a>
    </p>
